window.products.push({"id":484126,"name":"KAWERS Mattress Bag Queen Size for Moving and Storage Mattress Protector, Reusable Heavy Duty Tarp Waterproof Bed Mattress Cover, Zippered Mattress Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FJQiQrezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Mattress Bag for Moving and Storage] - KAWERS mattress bag is made of a heavy-duty tarp, which is specifically designed for moving and storage. Queen size bag measures 82\"X63\"X16\", suitable for queen-size mattresses. [Strong Carrying & Durable & Reusable] - KAWERS mattress bags use the thick tarp material. The tarpaulin is made of high-durability, high-rigidity polyester yarn, which is light, strong, durable, and has the characteristics of fast rebound. The bag is very sturdy and completely closed when zipped. Protection from moisture, water, dirt, dust, and bugs; mattresses and box springs are well protected when stored in the garage or up and down the stairs. And this mattress bag can be reused. [Water-Resistant Tarp Material] - KAWERS mattress bag is made of sturdy tarpaulin which is water-resistant that won't let water penetrate easily. The included zipper is also water-resistant. The queen mattress protector ensures stability when moving or transporting your queen size mattress. More convenient to be used in any weather. [8 Handles for Easy Movement]- KAWERS mattress bag queen comes with reinforced 2 thick sturdy and durable handles both on the front and the back, by which people can grab the bag with a heavy mattress inside easily much benefit for lifting a mattress up and down stairs. Help it be easier to grasp and carry during the moving process. At the same time, the mattress bag is also equipped with a high-quality zipper, which is not easy to crack when moving and storing. [5 Years Warranty] - We believe highly in the quality of our mattress bag for moving and storage. We provide 5 years warranty for your order. If you are unsatisfied with your purchase, contact us. We promise a satisfying solution for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FJQiQrezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAWERS","source_asin":"B0B5TLHVD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TLHVD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TLHVD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":484127,"name":"USA License Plate on Colorful Wood by Masters Fine Art, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T3OcN5amL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a collage of license plates in the shape of USA on a multicolor wood background. Masters Fine Art is a Publishing and distribution company that represents Artists around the world. We believe that art is the soul of the world, that it represents our human essence and that's why we work mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art we carry is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic. Above all, it is beautiful and happy. We strive to bring these wonderful works of art to your home, or any space in which you'd enjoy color and life. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T3OcN5amL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0728CGK89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0728CGK89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0728CGK89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
