window.products.push({"id":484230,"name":"Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Bin for Freezer, Ice Ball Maker Mold, Round Ice Cube Mold for Whiskey Ice Trays, Sphere Large Ice Cube Trays for Cocktails ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZSrSoYDGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Small & Large Ice Ball Maker Molds: There are 4 PCS molds in this ice trays set- 3 PCS Small round ice cube mold + 1 Large sphere ice cube mold. Small ice ball measures 1.3 inch (3.3cm), large ice ball measures 2.4 inch (6cm). This ice cube tray set makes 33 ice balls (30 small + 3 large) each time, the ice storage bin can hold 2 times of ice making. So, with just one buy, you got both small and big ice balls to enjoy your cool coffee, cocktails or whiskey. Safe and Convenient: The ice tray, ice storage bin and the ice scoop all are made of food-grade safety plastic material, and the ice tong is made of stainless steel. The lid and the ice storage bin keep ice cubes from absorbing freezer odor, and using the ice tong and scoop to take ice is more convenient and hygienic than using hand. The ice trays are stackable for space saving. Easy to clean, but DO NOT PUT the ice trays in Dryer or Dishwasher. Easy to Use: The ice ball maker mold consists of a tray and a lid with small holes. Just pour appropriate amount of water (about 80% full) into the ice tray at one time, put on the lid, then slowly press it tight to overflow excess water from the small holes and sides. Put the ice trays in the fridge steadily until completely frozen. Then, you get both small and large round ice cubes. Wide Application Ice Tray：The circle ice cube mold set includes - - 4 PCS ice cube tray with lid (1 Large round ice mold + 3 Small round ice molds), 1 ice storage container (11\" L x 8\" W x 4\" H), 1 ice scoop, 1 ice tongs, 1 user manual. You can fill the sphere ice cube with fruits juice, soda, cocktail, whisky, vodka, coffee, or any other wine to customize your favorite flavor drinks. Fits nicely in RV refrigerator and home fridges. Better Customer Service: Both the small ice sphere and large ice balls are in perfect size to melt slower and cool longer, they look spectacular in the glass and having clear frozen balls of ice make your drinks that much more special. So, just get one set to enjoy cool Summer time! If for any reason you are not completely satisfied with the ice cube trays, please contact us so we can provide a better solution for 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZSrSoYDGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digoyur","source_asin":"B09YCZ931V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YCZ931V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YCZ931V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
