window.products.push({"id":484461,"name":"BEE NUDE Beeswax Reusable Food Wraps. Australian Made with Organic Cotton, For Sustainable Food Storage. Assorted Pack of 3 (S, M, L) - Lasts Up to 1 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ap7-7WcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bee Nude specialises in sustainable products for sustainable living. Are you sick of using plastic wraps for food? Do you want to have a positive impact on the environment? Make the switch to beeswax food wraps, the perfect cling wrap alternative. Handcrafted in Australia using only natural quality ingredients: - GOTS certified organic cotton  - Locally sourced organic beeswax  - Locally sourced jojoba oil (free from artificial colors and preservatives)  - Dammar tree resin (harvested as a successful alternative to deforestation)  - Virgin coconut oil (provided by smallholder farmers, mostly women) All these ingredients play their part in making Bee Nude wraps easier to use and longer lasting. The naturally breathable cotton, together with the beeswax and jojoba oil, help preserve your items and keep your food fresher for longer. So not only are you minimising your plastic waste, you are minimising your food waste! Your wax wraps can be used to cover cheese, fruit, vegetables and other foods in the fridge; or perhaps carry snacks and sandwiches on the go. You can even use them to store your bread on the counter or in the freezer. Simply use the warmth of your hands to stick the wrap to itself when you fold it over your food items or bowls / storage containers. If you’re moving from plastic wrap you may miss that clingy effect - to mimic this, just give your wraps a little extra caressing so they hold in position. Wash your wraps with cold soapy water and a sponge before allowing to drip dry. Always keep away from heat and store in a drawer or on a bench top. You can dispose of them in a compost or a green bin knowing that they are 100% biodegradable. We also made sure we only used sustainable packaging, so you can simply recycle the cardboard sleeve after opening. Add this bees wax wrap to your list of zero waste products today! Be nice, Bee Nude.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ap7-7WcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEE NUDE","source_asin":"B08K8846C7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8846C7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8846C7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
