window.products.push({"id":484530,"name":"Siuhaau 3 Packs Ice Cube Trays with Lid and Bin for Freezer, Food-grade TPE 141 honeycomb 1\" small ice cubes(Green) Easy Release Ice Cube Molds for Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b9nu0kziL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material - Made of BPA-Free and Premium plastic, our ice cube tray is safe for health. The cover is PP, the body of bin is PET and the ice cube is PP and TPE, guaranteed to provide healthy for babies, children and adults. Very suitable for frozen whiskey, drinks, fruits, baby food, etc. Multipurpose Use - This Ice tray makes 141 honeycomb 1\" ice cubes each time, the ice box can holds 3 trays of cubes, each trays can make 47 cubes. Perfect compact size is 11.4(L) x 5.8(W) x 4.6(H) inches, fits nicely in RV refrigerator and Home Fridges. Our ice cube tarys can also be used in making Miniature dessert, such as Jelly, chocolate, frozon yogurt, perfect size for ice chewer. Easy to Release - Ice cubes release easily with just a twist. No need to wait for the ice cubes to melt a bit. You can empty the tray immediately after take it out from the freezer.This ice cube trays are made of soft materials which makes honeycomb ice cubes easy to release. After taking the mold out of the freezer, open the lid, twist the tray and press the bottom of the tray to release the ice. Space-Saving Feature - Manufactured so that the ice tray to spread over the top and so even if there is ice inside the tray, it can be stored together. You will get 3 ice cube trays, 1 storage container with lid and 1 free ice scoop. Our ice cube tray and bin are unique accessories that allow you to freeze and store ice easily and effortlessly. The ice cube tray has a stackable design that helps you to save space in the freezer. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - Our product is food grade and made of TPE. We are so confident in the quality and effectiveness of our product that if for any reason you don't love it as much as we do, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will spare no effort to get your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b9nu0kziL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siuhaau","source_asin":"B09V28Y6HB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V28Y6HB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V28Y6HB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
