window.products.push({"id":484615,"name":"BingLTD - 10\" Square Tapered Expresso Hardwood Sofa Legs - Set of 4 (ST2510-210)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N7wnUVw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About this Leg This Eco-Friendly leg features a wonderful finish, Beautiful wood grain, Durable quality and is equipped with a plastic glide on the bottom. This leg is attached using a 5/16\" hanger bolt. Installation is easy, Simply turn the leg to the right to install and left to remove. The image shown is a reference to the product when it was new and since it is used, scratches, bump or bruises are to be expected. Need Help Choosing the right size leg? Height will determine how high or low your furniture will sit. Top width is provided to ensure that legs do not stick out of the sides of the sofa. This leg is equipped with a 5/16\" hanger bolt. This is the most common size hanger bolt for American furniture. Some furniture (Especially European) comes with 10mm hanger bolts. You should measure to ensure which size hanger bolt is on your furniture. We do offer our Surefit Adapter Kit as a solution for furniture that requires a Different hanger bolt. If you have any questions feel free to contact us before ordering. We will be happy to help! About BingLTD Since 1987, BingLTD has made a conscious effort to be environmentally friendly by utilizing direct extraction of Hevea trees. Hevea is considered one of the most eco-friendly wood sources in the world. These trees are sourced via replanting programs to ensure continuity of supply and preservation of the environment. BingLTD sofa legs can be used with any existing furniture that has legs installed. Whether your need is small or large, with over 65,000 legs in STOCK we have you covered. Use our legs to change the height, style, appearance and feel of your furniture as you see fit. We have more than 80 different legs listed that offer a VARIETY of styles, stain finishes and size options. Just take a look around and imagine the endless possibilities!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N7wnUVw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BingLTD","source_asin":"B087GDMK2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087GDMK2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087GDMK2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":484616,"name":"Rev-A-Shelf 5349-1550DM-1 50 Quart Kitchen Cabinet Pull Out Waste Container Storage with Trash Can and Wire Basket for Full Height Cabinets, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":286.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pia0MkMwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rev-A-Shelf's 5349 series waste containers are definitely the premiere waste containers. These units are manufactured with Italian influences with brushed aluminum frame and a soft closing slides that glide in and out with complete ease. The included door mount hardware finish the look and allow you to mount your existing cabinet door directly to the waste container. Get your waste container off the floor and hide it inside one of your base cabinets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pia0MkMwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rev-A-Shelf","source_asin":"B07MHB98SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHB98SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHB98SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
