window.products.push({"id":484671,"name":"LZIMU Custom Canvas Wall Art Personalized Print with Your Photo on Canvas Customized Canvas Pictures for Home Office Decoration (8\"x12\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dzys+ikZL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"👩‍❤️‍👩【Custom Photo Canvas Print】: Customized personalized pictures can help you record the most precious memories in your life, allowing you to easily display beautiful photos. Capture wedding memories, baby and childhood moments, graduation, special family moments, and more. 👩‍❤️‍👩【Premium Quality】: We will use advanced printing press to print your photos on canvas, the printed canvas has vivid colors and clear patterns, and its texture is firm, comfortable touch and not easy to tear. The canvas fabric does not shrink, can be stored for a long time. 👩‍❤️‍👩【No Frame --- Only Canvas】: This personalized custom photo no frame means there is no wooden frame included, just canvas. We will leave a 3-4cm width blank on the edge of the canvas. The blank space is convenient for your to Install frame. If you don't need a white border, please contact us. 👩‍❤️‍👩【Personalized Photos for Wall】: It is suitable for perfect romantic and modern wall decor print art for home, such as apartment, office, study, fireplace, living room, hotel, bedroom, bathroom, dining room, kitchen, guest room, etc. It is also suitable for Weddings, Anniversaries, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthday, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine's Day or other important occasions. 👩‍❤️‍👩【Personalized Fantastic Gifts】: Unique custom canvas artwork will be the perfect gift for yourself, your loved one or your friend. The personalized canvas photo is a unique way to show love to your loved ones! 👩‍❤️‍👩【NOTE】: When upload photo, please make sure the photos covers the entire canvas area. The image you upload can only be stretched proportionally. Please choose the size that matches your photo. For best picture quality, upload your picture in \"JPEG\" file format, and high resolution image must be at least 75 DPI. Digital camera resolution must be 4 megapixels minimum. 👩‍❤️‍👩【Good Service】: Customer satisfaction is our aim! If you have any questions about this printed photos, please do no hesitate to contact us, we will solve or refund for you within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dzys+ikZL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LZIMU","source_asin":"B0B6RJZCW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6RJZCW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6RJZCW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":484672,"name":"Stormy Gray Onyx Aragonite Tyrannosaurus Rex, 6.5\" Long, 3.5\" Tall, (0.6lb), Carved from Real North American Gray Onyx Aragonite - The Artisan Mined S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yGQ0AwICL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Tyrannosaurus Rex carved from gray onyx aragonite. Each specimen features gray and white tones, veins, shocks, and bands. Each Tyrannosaurus Rex is mined, shaped, and finished with care by a family-owned company. At 6.5\" long, 1\" wide and 3.5\" tall, this Tyrannosaurus Rex figure is perfect for any setting- in your home, office or even your garden. The surprising weight and quality of these stones are hard to convey in an online listing: they are truly stunning. Every piece in the Artisan Mined collection is one of a kind and will vary slightly in color, shape and scenic markings. If you have a specific preference in look, please contact us and we will try to accommodate the request; however, we are not always able to honor these requests.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yGQ0AwICL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hBARSCI","source_asin":"B07GY21CG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GY21CG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GY21CG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
