window.products.push({"id":484765,"name":"Toter Wheeled Trash Can 32 Gal Black, Granite, Green, Stone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ir-R4qHaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Toter's 32-gallon trash cans have a long-lasting service life and are very durable. This can is designed to serve as either a waste bin or a recycling container. Toter cans are manufactured with Advanced Rotational Molding technology, which creates an impact-resistant can with superior durability. Toter trash cans are designed to keep working long after others fail - more than 2X longer. Transportation of the can is simple, no matter how full. This can is easy to tilt and roll from the garbage area to the waste collection area and back. The attached lid keeps contents securely inside. It is fully compatible with automated and semi-automated curbside collection pickup from waste collection trucks and mechanical lifters. Built with quiet-cap wheels that reduce noise when moving the can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ir-R4qHaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toter","source_asin":"B0787BSWVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0787BSWVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0787BSWVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":484766,"name":"8 oz White Copal Incense Resin Known as Dammar Gum Copal Blanco Enacaustic Gammar Resin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fw62fwi0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduction Dammar, also called dammar gum, or dammar gum is a resin obtained from the Dipterocarpaceae family of trees in India and East Asia, principally those of the genera Shorea or Hopea (synonym Balanocarpus). Most are produced by tapping trees. However, some are collected in fossilized form from the ground. The gum varies in color from clear to pale yellow, while the fossilized way is grey-brown. Dammar gum is a triterpenoid resin, containing many triterpenes and their oxidation products. What is damar resin used for? In encaustic paint dammar resin is the most common ingredient for hardening the beeswax and raising its melting temperature. Dammar allows the wax to be buffed to a higher, more translucent surface and helps prevent blooming in the wax. Making your own encaustic medium, it must be melted in the beeswax and strained. It also keeps the paint translucent and prevents blooming (whitening). It can also be polished to a glossy shine. How much Dammar resin you mix with the beeswax is a matter of personal preference. Typically, it's between four and eight measures of beeswax to one measure of Dammar resin, depending on how hard you want the result to be. You can make Dammar varnish by dissolving the resin in turpentine. Please note: The size, shape, and color of the resin you receive will vary slightly from that shown in the photo given the natural variations of the material.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fw62fwi0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aroma Depot","source_asin":"B07WFR5RD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFR5RD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFR5RD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
