window.products.push({"id":484777,"name":"Aspen & Birch - Modern Champagne Flutes Set of 4 - Champagne Glasses - Mimosa Glasses, Premium Crystal Stemware, Clear, 6 oz, Hand Blown Glass Champag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714aiDaXKES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ EXQUISITE GLASSES FOR CHAMPAGNE LOVERS - Overwhelm your senses with the pairing of fine champagne and the modern design of these stunning glasses by Aspen & Birch. Stylish, classy, and strikingly clear - A tall cylindrical bowl and long graceful stem elegantly show off a lovely champagne. This is not your average glass! A stemless glass changes the temperature of the champagne by the heat of your hand - order a sturdy and stemmed glass, and savor your champagne the way it was intended! ✅ A BEAUTIFUL GIFT FOR ALL OCCASIONS - Make a toast to the most meaningful moments in life with the PERFECT GIFT from the heart - Weddings, anniversaries, engagements, bridal showers, or just everyday casual use. A unique gift idea - LUXURY & SOPHISTICATION - Enthusiasts, romantics, and guests will surely be impressed by these glamorous glasses. Impress even more and use these flutes for Prosecco, sparkling wines, or beautiful champagne cocktails for Christmas and New Year's Eve celebrations. ✅ TRADITIONAL HANDMADE CRAFTSMANSHIP - These aren't the typical, machine made, basic, cheap, plastic flutes or disposable bulk champagne glasses being produced the quickest way possible. Molten glass is shaped by hand and mouth blown by our master artisans with over 10 years experience. The thin smooth rim is designed to enhance each sip while toasting with your favorite golden drink after that satisfying pop of the cork - a true definition of EXPERIENCE shared with that special someone. ✅ 100% LEAD FREE PREMIUM CRYSTAL - Aspen & Birch premium glassware is made from 100% lead free ultra clear crystal glass. Brilliance and elegance of fine crystal glass stemware, meticulously crafted to enhance an expensive champagne. What about those \"unbreakable\" plastic acrylic, silicone, or stainless steel champagne cups without stems you ask? Those are ok for the pool, but when you're wanting to CELEBRATE special moments or memories, crystal glass is FAR SUPERIOR in making an IMPRESSION! ✅ PROTECTED PACKAGING & OUR 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Make your purchase with confidence and rest assured your gift will get to you or your loved ones in one piece - flawless condition, safe & secure, in the extra sturdy protective foam and sleek gift box packaged to prevent breakages. We take extra care hand wrapping and packing each flute in our contemporary boxes. Our no-worries, Aspen & Birch 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - Amazing glasses and amazing service will always be our standard!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714aiDaXKES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aspen & Birch","source_asin":"B0859XSCQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-484777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859XSCQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859XSCQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
