window.products.push({"id":485000,"name":"Cotton Candy Machine, Portable Countertop Cotton Candy Maker With Splash-Proof Cricle, Candy Floss Maker Includes Two Recyclable Candy Sricks (Color R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PmWPAhLvL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"☺[ Homemade Marshmallow For Everyon ]：This cotton candy machine uses almost no noise. Install the splash ring, turn on the cotton candy machine to preheat for about three minutes, then follow the instructions add some favorite candies, you will soon get a cute marshmallow, try it with your child! ☺[ More Than One Choice ]：Whether it is flossing sugar, hard candies, sugar-free hard candies, cube sugar... All can be used to make cotton candy, pink, blue, purple, the appearance of cotton candy is up to you! ☺[ Easy Clean & Disassemble ]：After the cotton candy machine cools down, remove the splash-proof cricle, undertakr plate cover and the sugar-heating plate, place them in warm water and soak for a while, it is easy to wash away the residual sugar. ☺[ Multiple Occasions ]：This cotton candy machine can not only be used to make cotton candy every day, as a portable desktop cotton candy machine it is also very suitable for children's birthday, parties, school events, and markets. There is no noise when using it, giving you a quiet and comfortable cotton candy time! ☺[ Practical Detailed Design ]：This cotton candy machine is not only cute in appearance, the transparent splash-proof cricle prevents the candy from flying out, and at the same time protects you and your children when making cotton candy. There is also a suction cup at the bottom of the cotton candy machine, which fixes the cotton candy machine on the table and increases the stability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PmWPAhLvL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gatling Bubble","source_asin":"B09P32NF6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P32NF6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P32NF6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
